# ============================================================================
# FILES THAT SHOULD BE TRACKED
# ============================================================================

# DO TRACK THESE:
# ✓ .env.example - template (WITHOUT secrets)
# ✓ *.md files - documentation
# ✓ *.py files - scripts
# ✓ requirements.txt - dependencies
# ✓ config.py - base configuration (NO SECRETS)
# ✓ .gitignore - this file

